    "created_at": "2020-05-19T21:51:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-19T21:52:09Z",
    "body": "Hey @palash25, can you check if disabling the [instant prompt](https://github.com/romkatv/powerlevel10k#instant-prompt) feature as @davidkna suggested fixes the issue for you? Starship should be overriding it looking at your configuration. That said, any theme initialized before starship will add to the prompt render time so it's suggested that any other prompt be disabled when using Starship.",
