    "created_at": "2020-05-20T15:38:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-20T15:39:01Z",
    "body": "Ideally Starship would overwrite whichever other themes you initialized beforehand, but it's likely that whatever is set by having your `ZSH_THEME` overwrites anything that Starship changes. 😅 \r\n\r\nHaving two prompts enabled for your shell is bound to cause issues for one or the other. Seeing as you still have configuration enabling another prompt, I think it's outside of the scope of what Starship handles at initialization.\r\n\r\nI'll be closing this issue for now, but feel free to let us know if you feel strongly that this is something we should address.",
